/*
  MediaHistoryWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0062 · MediaHistoryWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `MediaHistoryWidget` resolves (table "MediaHistoryWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  Keys under "widget.mediaHistory" / "widget.noMediaPlayed" are the exact keys
  extracted from the web source (features/dashboard/widgets/MediaHistoryWidget.tsx,
  namespace "dashboard"). The remaining "widget.media.*" keys back the native-only
  chrome (freshness chip, refresh/open/retry, states, relative-time, accessibility).
*/

